                <li>Promotion date start from Saturday 8th August 2020 (00:00 GMT+8) until Monday 7th September 2020 (23:59 GMT+8)<br><br></li>
                <li>This Promotion only entitle for MYR, THB & IDR currencies only.<br><br></li>
            </ol>

