                <li>Cash prize give away for Top 3 highest Million High Rollers only.<br><br></li>
                <li>Only 3 winners from each currency will be notified by member’s account inbox from Nova88.<br><br></li>
                <li>Cash Prize will be release to winners within 48 hours after the cut off time on Monday 7th September 2020 (23:59 GMT+8)<br><br></li>
